          "title": "You'll want to know: പരിപാലിക്കുക",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "പരിപാലിക്കുക — paripālikkuka — \"to look after; to maintain\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "വിരമിച്ച ശേഷം അച്ഛൻ പൂന്തോട്ടം പരിപാലിക്കുന്നു. viramicca śēṣaṁ acchan pūntōṭṭaṁ paripālikkunnu. Since retiring, Father has been looking after the garden."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Past: പരിപാലിച്ചു, paripāliccu."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "The noun is പരിപാലനം, upkeep."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "പരിപാലിക്കുക (paripālikkuka) is built from Sanskrit paripālana, \"guarding, fostering\" (Monier-Williams), with the Malayalam verb ending -ിക്കുക."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 3,
          "type": "notice",
          "title": "What you've built",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "One more word for describing what you lived and felt."
            }
          ]
        },
